{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14800","headline":"詶苗员外仲夏归郊居遇雨见寄 · 卢纶","name":"詶苗员外仲夏归郊居遇雨见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雷响风仍急，人归鸟亦还。\n乱云方至水，骤雨已喧山。\n田鼠依林上，池鱼戏草间。\n因兹屏埃雾，一咏一开颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}